menu "BSP LVGL Framework"

config BSP_LVGL_MAIN_TASK_STACK_SIZE
    int "LVGL main task stack size"
    default 24576
    range 8192 65536
    help
        Stack size, in bytes, for the LVGL main task. ESP-Brookesia Phone
        creates a larger widget tree than the local diagnostic UI, so the
        default leaves enough headroom for launcher animations and app startup.

endmenu
